# Preserve Alpha brand surfaces

When porting Beyondtechworld / Stocky ERP into Alpha Bridge:

## Never replace or overwrite

- Public landing (`src/pages/HomePage.jsx`)
- About Us (`src/pages/AboutPage.jsx`)
- Shareholders public + admin share/agreement flows
- Alpha Site Content CMS branding for the marketing site
- Alpha MySQL database name / production `.env` pointing at Beyond’s DB

## Allowed to change

- Admin ERP pages under `src/pages/admin/erp/**`
- `apps/api/src/routes/erp/**` and ERP schema patches
- Admin sidebar ERP menu items (not marketing menus)

## Deploy

Only Alpha Bridge VPS root `/var/www/alphabridge`. Never stop or rewrite Beyond’s site.
